{"title":"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 32","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_32&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/7/b977ccf3cca4da3377797673659f910aa9a9d34e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{a+b}{b+c}=\\dfrac{c+d}{d+a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"111\" height=\"39\" />, then:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/1/4f17a2193c3e9d47ddbc0b71a75d8e1ce409388c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }a \\text{ must equal }c\\qquad\\textbf{(B) }a+b+c+d\\text{ must equal zero}\\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"433\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/0/330339be1aef352d386a88e686f92abae4d2485a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(C) }\\text{either }a=c\\text{ or }a+b+c+d=0\\text{, or both}\\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"348\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/3/b8386f881f25b7d2c04fffd77f97dd6ae5f5c2d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(D) }a+b+c+d\\ne 0\\text{ if }a=c\\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"233\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/0/6e0f8bf08c1eb52e867b46fd6f24af7d0faeb5bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(E) }a(b+c+d)=c(a+b+d)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"243\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_32&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Cross-multiplying gives:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/b/ceb5f4107a23baf70fb2c6b58a655908e6fe9e64.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a+b)(a+d) = (b+c)(c+d)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"237\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/9/5991f25c606580f5db703fce2f5203bb5426d4e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2 + ad + ab + bd = bc + bd + c^2 + cd$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"294\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/2/702535665ce6c0fff1db85eefb82dd886302402f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2 + ad + ab   - bc - c^2 - cd = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"245\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/c/c2c51194bc6491052f4377f6cc8a7bf138b8b30f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a(a + b + d) - c(b+c+d)= 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"241\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>This looks close to turning into option C, but we don't have a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> term in the first parentheses, and we don't have an <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> term in the second parentheses to allow us to complete the factorization.  However, if we both add <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/f/90fe8263dd262c6d4d42e5e955afefd6adc0917c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ac$\" width=\"17\" height=\"8\" /> and subtract <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/f/90fe8263dd262c6d4d42e5e955afefd6adc0917c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ac$\" width=\"17\" height=\"8\" /> on the LHS, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/0/8402487a99e3da157c13f5d57fcd32e29b3e942b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a(a + b + d) + ac - c(b+c+d) - ca= 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"323\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/d/3edc772eb71022bc0aa79a00ac6997ffaf16fa6d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a(a+b+d +c) - c(b+c+d+a) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"303\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/d/abd83d549f54a00b4b40fa44d1ba61ab1077e77c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a-c)(a+b+c+d) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"205\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>This is equivalent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/f/fffc7368e8e7b77c88b0b4bf732c88c60e27b439.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"42\" height=\"30\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_32&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME\" title=\"1964 AHSME\">1964 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1964 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1964\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_31\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 31\